From a6e0ad955ec59d99b91b804ce0a3d2f6ca4cf5c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nitrogen <Nitrogen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 2 May 2026 15:07:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Apply 14 community PRs + fix session_search ordering

Community PRs applied:
- #18596: Enable secret redaction by default (SECURITY)
- #18650: Sanitize malformed tool messages + auto-recover on API 400
- #18607: Emergency compression before max_iterations exhaustion
- #18603: Compression fallback to main model on 413 rate limit
- #18638: Pass threshold_percent on model switch
- #18663: Strip extra_content from tool_calls for strict APIs
- #18618: Forward explicit_api_key to OpenRouter
- #18632: Show cache tokens in /insights breakdown
- #18614: Add idempotency guard for patch duplicate loops
- #18600: Raise ValueError when HERMES_HOME unset in profile mode
- #18616: Allow ZWJ emoji in context files
- #18582: Reload .env on /restart
- #18547: Stabilize system prompt prefix for KV cache reuse
- #18692: Strip FTS5 operators from session search truncation terms

Fix: Add order_by_last_active=True to list_sessions_rich call
(pre-existing commit 142b4bf3c code sync)
